  "details": "It would be nice to have a legitimate way to intervene in the VRC settings.\n\nTo prevent weird bugs, I want to prevent overriding camera settings. If the following bugs were left ignored and VRC stores the Camera Settings, users who have come to the world will be left confused.\n\nI can implement the coping code on Udon by OnCameraSettingsChanged, and something. However, it's not something that anyone can implement well.\n\nBug details:\n\n Well known: The rendering doesn't work well.\n\n Lesser known: The problem with UI(VRChat Menu) control at a distance from the Origin-Position. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/camera-near-clip-override-cause-problem-on-ui-controlling",
